## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0652, std = 0.1392, ICIR = 0.47, HAC t-stat = 7.6 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0795, std = 0.1375, IR = 0.58, HAC t-stat = 9.5 (lags=5)
- 注：采用 Newey–West(HAC) t-stat 以处理日度序列的自相关/异方差。

